          {
            "title": "Lists and indices",
            "id": 89310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>user_answers</code> gibi listelerdeki öğelere, burada <code>0</code> ile olduğu gibi, dizinleri aracılığıyla erişebileceğimizi ve onları güncelleyebileceğimizi biliyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_answers[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[1]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"yes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>user_answers[0]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>user_answers</code> gibi listeler sıralıdır, bu nedenle bir öğeyi indeksiyle okuyabiliriz. <code>no</code> değerine eşit olan öğeyi yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user_answers\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[0]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[1]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[3]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"no\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>user_answers[2]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "No indices",
            "id": 89311,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listelerin aksine, <code>answer_options</code> gibi kümeler sırasızdır; yani küme öğelerinin indeksleri yoktur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_answers[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>answer_options</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>{\"yes\", \"no\"}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listelerin aksine, <code>answer_options</code> gibi kümeler sırasızdır; yani küme öğelerinin indeksleri yoktur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_answers[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;yes&quot;, &quot;no&quot;]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;yes&quot;, &quot;no&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>answer_options</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>{\"yes\", \"no\"}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "in keyword",
            "id": 89312,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kümelerin indeksleri olmadığından, bir kümenin <code>\"no\"</code> gibi bir öğe içerip içermediğini yalnızca <code>in</code> anahtar sözcüğüyle kontrol edebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer_options)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"44\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>in</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 89313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ayrıca bir for döngüsü kullanarak küme öğeleri arasında yineleme yapabilir ve burada <code>answer</code> değişkeninde olduğu gibi bunlara tek tek erişebilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer_options:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Option: \" /><text value=\"{answer}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Option: no\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Option: yes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>answer</code>, ardından <code>answer</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>for</code> döngüsü set öğelerine tek tek erişir. Döngü değişkeni olarak <code>answer</code> kullan ve her değerden önce <code>Option:</code> görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer_options:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Option: \" /><text value=\"{answer}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"answer_options\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>answer</code> ve son olarak <code>answer</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No indices",
            "id": 89397,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kümelerin sırasız olması ne anlama gelir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İndeksleri yoktur, bu yüzden öğelere indeksleriyle erişemeyiz veya onları güncelleyemeyiz.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tüm öğeler aynı dizine sahiptir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İndeksleri yoktur, bu yüzden öğelere indeksleriyle erişemeyiz veya onları güncelleyemeyiz..</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setler sırasızdır ve indeksleri yoktur, bu nedenle öğelere indeksle erişemeyiz veya onları indeksle güncelleyemeyiz.</p><p><code>colors</code> adlı bir set için hangi işlemden kaçınmalısın?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colors[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for color in colors:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors.add(\"green\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>colors[0]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
